@StudyFlowApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5130

### Listar todas as tarefas
GET {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Buscar tarefa por ID
GET {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

### Criar tarefa
POST {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Minimal APIs",
  "description": "Revisar endpoints e programação assíncrona",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-20",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Atualizar tarefa
PUT {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Minimal APIs e EF Core",
  "description": "Conteúdo revisado e exercício concluído",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-20",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Excluir tarefa
DELETE {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
